TITLE Calcite kinetics at 200C, pH 2, Cu and Ba present
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    -water 1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 1000 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -molalities CO2
END
